tde-systemd-trinity (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the source and binary package from "tde-systemd" to "tde-systemd-trinity",
    so that all Trinity add-on packages follow the
    tde-<name>-trinity scheme. The new package replaces and breaks
    the old one, so installing it removes the old package.
    No functional changes.

 -- Yjlion <32956705+Yjlion@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 21:15:20 -0500

tde-systemd (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Systemd Manager with overview, services, timers, date & time,
      hostname and locale pages for the system and user managers.
    - Journal Viewer with filters, follow mode, export and maintenance.
    - TDE Control Center modules.
    - polkit authorized helper for system changes.
    - Handbook and manual pages.

 -- Yjlion <32956705+Yjlion@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500
